== Flake vs Reality workshop

OtaNix ry organized a workshop on the topic of Nix flakes. Pizza, drink and snacks were offered.

OtaNix ry board and \@SomeoneSerge had prepared a set of flake-related presentations:
- #link("/assets/events/nix-workshop-2026-04-14/intro-slides.pdf")[Intro slides] by Luukas
- #link("/assets/events/nix-workshop-2026-04-14/nixos-flakes.pdf")[Intro to flakes + NixOS with flakes] by Roy
- #link("/assets/events/nix-workshop-2026-04-14/flake-infrastructure.pdf")[The flake ecosystem] by Matias
- #link("https://someonex.net/scratch/ota-flakes/")[The case against flakes] by \@SomeoneSerge (+ Luukas)
- #link("/assets/events/nix-workshop-2026-04-14/flakes-at-work.pdf")[Flakes at work] by Luukas

The source code and assets for the presentations are available in #link("https://github.com/OtaNix-ry/workshop")[this GitHub repository].

